{"id":"n36872-2-8","stage":2,"title":"귀신 · 鬼神","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36872-2-8-1","ko":"너는 세상에서 제일 무서운 게 뭐야?","zh":"你认为这世上最可怕的东西是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"세상에서","meaning":"世上，世间","explanation":"세상：世上，世间；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"세상","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62441","senseId":"2","lemma":"세상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세상에서","audio":"/audio/eeb5501f9d20e71849eb.mp3"}},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}},{"text":"무서운","meaning":"可怕，恐怖，畏惧","explanation":"무섭다：可怕，恐怖，畏惧；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55637","senseId":"2","lemma":"무섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무서운","audio":"/audio/18b93c56dfe071e33206.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","se